			"hadithnumber": 178,
			"arabicnumber": 178,
			"text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Do you crowd one another in order to see the moon on the night when it is full?' They said: 'No.' He said: 'And you will not crowd one another in order to see your Lord on the Day of Resurrection",
